  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds.\n• Toss fries to coat, then bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649150ac6832ec1f20138f8a-490d0a65.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice spring onion.\n• Grate carrot, then squeeze out any excess moisture with a paper towel.\n• Finely chop garlic. Slice apple into thin sticks. Trim pea pods. Roughly chop coriander.\n• Drain sweetcorn. TIP: Removing excess liquid from the veggies will help the fritters crisp up in the pan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649150ac6832ec1f20138f8a-87578083.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To a medium bowl, add carrot, sweetcorn, coriander, spring onion, garlic, Southeast Asian spice blend, the plain flour and the milk. TIP: Lift out some of the mixture with a spoon. If it's too wet and doesn't hold its shape, add a little more flour!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649150ac6832ec1f20138f8a-617ae321.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook heaped tablespoons of the fritter mixture, in batches, until golden, 3-4 minutes each side (don't flip too early!).\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Add extra oil between batches as needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649150ac6832ec1f20138f8a-c606f5f7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When fritters are almost done, combine Japanese style dressing, mixed salad leaves, apple and pea pods in a second medium bowl. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649150ac6832ec1f20138f8a-6a9678d5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn fritters, pea pod salad and sesame sweet potato fries between plates.\n• Drizzle mayonnaise over fritters to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-649150ac6832ec1f20138f8a-370396c4.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
